<title>USA: Disney exploring options for ABC publishing.</title>
<headline>Disney exploring options for ABC publishing.</headline>
<dateline>BURBANK, Calif. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Walt Disney Co said it plans to explore its options related to the publishing operations it bought as part of its acquisition of Capital Cities/ABC.</p>
<p>The operations are included in the company's Creative Content segment and include the printing and distribution of daily and weekly newspapers, specialized publications for various industries, and consumer, special interest and agricultural publications.</p>
